#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "What problems does it solve?"
msgstr "¿Qué problemas soluciona?"

#: src/features/landing/components/PricingSection.tsx
msgid "Whether you are an individual athlete or running a growing sports club — find the real plan that fits. Transparent pricing with no hidden fees."
msgstr "Tanto si eres un deportista individual como si diriges un club en expansión: encuentra el plan que mejor se adapte. Precios claros y sin costes ocultos."

#: src/features/landing/components/ComparisonSection.tsx
msgid "Why Ride With Pals?"
msgstr "¿Por qué Ride With Pals?"

#: src/features/landing/components/PricingSection.tsx
msgid "Yearly"
msgstr "Anual"

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes, absolutely. Strava is optional."
msgstr "Sí, totalmente. El uso de Strava es opcional."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes, it works perfectly well for them. Although the main categories currently available are Cycling, Running, and Triathlon, any sport where groups meet to follow a route, use a GPS track, and track their progress by distance and time can find the perfect club management tool in our app."
msgstr "Sí, funciona a la perfección. Aunque las categorías principales son Ciclismo, Running y Triatlón, cualquier deporte grupal que siga rutas GPS y mida tiempos o distancias encontrará en nuestra app la herramienta idónea."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. A chat is created for every activity, allowing participants to discuss topics related specifically to that activity. You can also chat privately with members of your club."
msgstr "Sí. Se genera un chat exclusivo para cada actividad y además puedes conversar de forma privada con cualquier socio de tu club."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. Administrators can accept or remove members."
msgstr "Sí. Los administradores pueden admitir o dar de baja a miembros."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. Ride with Pals charges a small 4% management fee on each transaction."
msgstr "Sí. Ride with Pals aplica una pequeña comisión de gestión del 4% en cada transacción."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. The club's News section allows users to comment on each post, with all the conversation kept together in a forum-style format."
msgstr "Sí. La sección de Noticias permite que los socios comenten cada publicación, manteniendo la conversación agrupada estilo foro."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. You can create public activities."
msgstr "Sí. Puedes crear actividades abiertas al público."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. You can publish the same activity in as many clubs as you belong to. You can also make it public so that people outside your clubs can join."
msgstr "Sí. Puedes publicar una misma actividad en todos los clubes a los que pertenezcas o hacerla pública para que se unan deportistas externos."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. You can schedule activities on a weekly, biweekly, or monthly basis."
msgstr "Sí. Puedes programar salidas con periodicidad semanal, quincenal o mensual."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. You can upgrade at any time."
msgstr "Sí. Puedes cambiar de plan cuando quieras."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "You can define the permissions available to administrators and members, such as creating news posts, creating activities, and sharing discounts. You can appoint as many administrators as you wish."
msgstr "Puedes configurar los permisos para administradores y socios (publicar noticias, crear actividades, compartir ofertas) y designar a tantos administradores como desees."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "You need a Gold club subscription, a free Stripe account, and you must connect it to the app."
msgstr "Necesitas una suscripción Club Gold, una cuenta gratuita en Stripe y conectarla con la app."
